application.

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:57.860
Now, let's leave a short
message in our guestbook--

00:11:57.860 --> 00:12:01.220
Hello, Google Cloud.

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:02.450
And we're set.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:04.220
We deployed our
guestbook application

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:05.960
